Qwen2.5 1.5B Instruct (Q4_K_M GGUF): the model the Windows app's installer carries
===================================================================================

This directory records the one model the Windows installer of Crimson Noir: Agent City carries beside the app, so a
person who installs it can talk to Sloane from the first launch with no model of their own. The model's weights are
NOT in this repository, NOT in the page file (dist/index.html) and NOT in the bare .exe: the Windows workflow
(.github/workflows/windows-app.yml, through tools/web/siteModel.mjs) fetches the file below from Hugging Face at the
pinned revision whenever its cache (keyed by the pin) does not hold it, refuses it unless its size and SHA-256 are
exactly these, and puts it into the installer (src-tauri/tauri.model.conf.json) as
models/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf in the app's folder, with this NOTICE and LICENSE beside it. The page reads it
through the app (src-tauri/src/model.rs) once the city is on screen, checks the same size and SHA-256
(src/09_Cognition/siteModel.ts APP_MODEL), and keeps a copy in the app's own page storage.

  Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf   986048768 bytes, sha256 1adf0b11065d8ad2e8123ea110d1ec956dab4ab038eab665614adba04b6c3370
  (SHA256SUMS beside this file has the same line)

Where it comes from
-------------------

- The model: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, by the Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud. Licence: Apache License 2.0. Copyright 2024
