  Qwen repository on Hugging Face (Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct) carries it. The repository has no NOTICE file.
- The file: a GGUF conversion of those weights quantized to Q4_K_M with an importance matrix by bartowski, published
  as bartowski/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-GGUF on Hugging Face, revision 9eadc66189c7641e1ddd226b8267a9119b2ce2d4
  (quantized with llama.cpp release b3772; the repository names its licence as apache-2.0 and carries no licence file
  of its own). Under section 4(b) of the licence: the file is that conversion of Qwen's weights (format and numeric
  precision changed by the quantization); Crimson Noir: Agent City ships it exactly as published and changes nothing
  in it.

The model remains under its own licence, not under the product's licence. "Qwen" is a name of Alibaba Cloud, used
here only to say which model this is.
